{"id":41,"date":"2013-11-25T21:15:40","date_gmt":"2013-11-25T21:15:40","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/?page_id=41"},"modified":"2013-11-25T23:26:43","modified_gmt":"2013-11-25T23:26:43","slug":"testimonials","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/testimonials\/","title":{"rendered":"Testimonials"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-350 lazyload\" alt=\"ellis-fermor-negus-middle-size\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/11\/ellis-fermor-negus-middle-size.jpg\" width=\"224\" height=\"36\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 224px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 224\/36;\" \/><\/p>\n<blockquote>&#8220;We have used Sign and Print for several years now for various design and print services. They are always more than accommodating towards our company&#8217;s needs, often producing goods with tight deadlines and exceeding expectations with adhoc work requests.&#8221;<br \/>\n<cite>Ellis-Fermor &amp; Negus Solicitors<\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"headway logo\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/11\/headway-logo.jpg\" width=\"256\" height=\"48\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 256px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 256\/48;\" \/><\/p>\n<blockquote>&#8220;Sign &amp; Print have been working for Headway charity shops over the last 8 years with their shop signage external boards.  Both in the Midlands and up in the NW too. Nigel and his team are always 100% reliable, professional and I would recommend their work to anyone<i>.<\/i>&#8221;<br \/>\n<cite>Jo Finch &#8211; Headway Retail<\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-145 lazyload\" alt=\"albe solutions logo\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/11\/albe-solutions.gif\" width=\"220\" height=\"72\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 220px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 220\/72;\" \/><\/p>\n<blockquote>&#8220;We have used Sign &amp; Print in Ripley for several years, the team are second to none always supplying whatever products we require on time and made to the highest quality and at very very competitive prices.&#8221;<br \/>\n<cite>ALBE Solutions<\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-149 lazyload\" alt=\"the phoneshop logo\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/11\/phoneshop-logo.gif\" width=\"197\" height=\"48\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 197px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 197\/48;\" \/><\/p>\n<blockquote>&#8220;From totally changing our company branding with great finesse, the new look that the design and fit team at sign and print gave the Phoneshop was amazing to see when unveiled at our Ripley Oxford Street store, not only the signs but also internal shop fittings and graphics, window posters, pavement signs, business cards and letterheads, even our Corporate Team website \u2013 we struggled to find anything that Sign and Print can\u2019t help us with.&#8221;<br \/>\n<cite>Johnsons of Ripley<\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-147 lazyload\" alt=\"metalcraft group logo\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/11\/metalcraft-logo.gif\" width=\"195\" height=\"50\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 195px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 195\/50;\" \/><\/p>\n<blockquote>&#8220;Sign &amp; Print Ripley have always produced our stationery requirements, creating our new logo and recently giving us a fantastic new bespoke sign that now gives our company a much higher profile on a crowded industrial estate environment. Whatever we ask of them, they always meet our requirements.&#8221;<br \/>\n<cite>Metalcraft Group (Mansfield)<\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-148 lazyload\" alt=\"pentalpha logo\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/11\/pentalpha-logo.gif\" width=\"156\" height=\"89\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 156px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 156\/89;\" \/><\/p>\n<blockquote>&#8220;We need graphics quickly for our prestigious bluechip exhibition displays, Sign and Print at Ripley never fail us, our tight deadlines are always accommodated even sending products overseas to our fitters and advising outside fitters on our behalf. We highly recommend them for a skilled, qualified and well honed service.&#8221;<br \/>\n<cite>Pentalpha<\/cite><\/blockquote>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>&#8220;We have used Sign and Print for several years now for various design and&#8230; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/testimonials\/\">Read More&nbsp;&raquo;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":143,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"ngg_post_thumbnail":0,"footnotes":""},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/41"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"a